      "id": "2073787052600995901",
      "text": "text-to-lottie now supports text editing\n\nGenerate Lottie templates with Claude Code, Codex or Cursor\n\nPerfect for teams: create once, reuse anytime\n\nTry it: $ npx skills add diffusionstudio/lottie https://t.co/TUhAj7zBUM",
