      "id": "2073787054966661384",
      "text": "What's new:\n- Native text rendering \n- Bundled scene fonts in exports\n- Instant canvas updates for text edit\n- Multiline text wrapping\n- Unicode safe text persistence\n- Grouped controls for repeated text, color and number slots\n- Bug fixes\n\nhttps://t.co/1ZfLCLFWVB",
